{"root":"berani","ipa":"/bərani/","core":"形容词，指具有勇气、胆量或无畏精神的；动词，指敢于做某事。","pos":["形容词","动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/bərani/","zh":"勇敢的，有胆量的；敢于","phrases":[{"t":"berani mati","zh":"不怕死"},{"t":"berani jujur","zh":"敢于诚实"},{"t":"tidak berani","zh":"不敢"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia sangat berani menghadapi tantangan itu.","zh":"他非常有勇气面对那个挑战。"},{"t":"Jangan berani-berani menipu saya.","zh":"别胆敢欺骗我。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"berani","ipa":"/bərani/","zh":"勇敢的","phrase":{"t":"berani berbuat","zh":"敢作敢当"},"example":{"t":"Anak itu berani sekali.","zh":"那个孩子非常勇敢。"}},{"w":"keberanian","ipa":"/kəbəranian/","zh":"勇气，胆量","phrase":{"t":"keberanian moral","zh":"道德勇气"},"example":{"t":"Dia memiliki keberanian untuk mengakui kesalahannya.","zh":"他有承认错误的勇气。"}},{"w":"memberanikan","ipa":"/məmbəranikan/","zh":"使……有勇气，鼓起勇气","phrase":{"t":"memberanikan diri","zh":"鼓起勇气"},"example":{"t":"Dia memberanikan diri untuk bertanya kepada guru.","zh":"他鼓起勇气向老师提问。"}},{"w":"keberanian-keberanian","ipa":"/kəbəraniankəbəranian/","zh":"各种勇气（复数形式）","phrase":{"t":"berbagai keberanian","zh":"各种各样的勇气"},"example":{"t":"Keberanian-keberanian yang ditunjukkan para pahlawan sangat menginspirasi.","zh":"英雄们所展现出的各种勇气非常鼓舞人心。"}}],"derSlugs":["berani","keberanian","memberanikan","keberanian-keberanian"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-25T09:45:14.528Z","src":"base"}